Aethyrforge reimplements these contracts in its owned
Rust/Wasm kernel and direct WebGPU renderer. Its coarse scene cells, triangle
ownership stream, runtime bridge, geometry limits, and rendering are new
implementations. Licensed kit art and derived fracture geometry remain private
runtime assets and are not part of this source distribution.

Meteor Shower adapts Grove's six-impact Meteor Swarm. Lightning Bolt is the
horizontal beam; Thunderbolt is the separate sky strike. Aethyrforge uses local
play-session damage with no mana cost or multiplayer authority. Active cast
times remain, and movement continues during casting.

